    {
      "title": "Курсор подписки — после отданного события",
      "text": "Ещё два показания. Подписка читает журнал пачками и может прочесть оба события сразу, но `sub.cursor` не обгоняет то, что она ещё не отдала: после одного `next()` он равен курсору отданного события. Его и сохраняют, обработав событие. Подписку закрываем — процесс остановлен.",
      "code": "await me.Gauge().create({ name: 'Влажность', value: 40 }).rows();\nawait me.Gauge().create({ name: 'Ветер', value: 3 }).rows();\nconst ev = (await sub.next()).value;\nsaved = sub.cursor!;\nsub.close();\nreturn { 'отдано': ev.row.data.name, 'sub.cursor совпадает с ev.cursor': saved === ev.cursor };",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> me.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Gauge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Влажность'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rows</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> me.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Gauge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Ветер'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rows</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ev</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sub.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()).value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">saved </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sub.cursor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sub.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'отдано'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: ev.row.data.name, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sub.cursor совпадает с ev.cursor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: saved </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ev.cursor };</span></span></code></pre>",
